      "category": "Text",
      "text": "XIII. In instances of employees earning insufficient compensation, employee organization dues will be considered last in arithmetical sequence; therefore, where residual amount of pay after other deductions is less than full amount of dues, no fractional amount of dues deduction will be made nor carried over for dues deduction in any subsequent payroll period.",
